<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<style>
span
            {
                font-size: 2em;
                vertical-align: baseline;
            }
</style>
</head>
<body>
        <p>Test passes if the bottoms of all the 'X's are aligned.</p>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td>XXXXX<span>XXXXX</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    
</body>
</html>
